  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I sometimes stores variables of type VrcPlayerApi as cache. But if stored VrcPlayerApi leaves the instance, there is no way to detect directly if stored VrcPlayerApi is invalid (it won't become NULL), and if I try using that VrcPlayerApi, it causes internal NullReferenceException that makes udon broken.\nI want VrcPlayerApi validation method (such as VrcPlayerApi.IsValid()) so I can detect if stored VrcPlayerApi can be usable.",
